  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Philippines typhoon Haiyan 2013: Emergency relief</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Typhoon Haiyan was one of the strongest typhoons to hit Philippines, affecting 14.6 million people and damaging 1.1 million houses. Even 3 weeks after the typhoon&apos;s landfall, response efforts continue to scale-up as 3.5 million people remain displaced from their homes displaying the need to additional assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
